---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description: "About Green — developer, tinkerer, and builder of projects at the intersection of hardware and software.",
	title: "About",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>

	<h1 class="title mb-6">About</h1>
	<div class="prose prose-citrus max-w-none">
		<p>
			Hi, I'm Green — a developer who enjoys building things at the intersection of hardware and software.
			From LED matrix visualisations and MicroPython microcontrollers to distributed computing with Dask,
			I like turning interesting ideas into working projects.
		</p>
		<p>
			This site is where I share write-ups of personal projects, technical notes, and documentation
			for tools I build and maintain.
		</p>
		<h2>What I work on</h2>
		<p>
			Recent projects include a real-time weather visualiser for an LED matrix that maps temperature
			to colour and wind speed to waveform height, and a moon-position tracker that computes azimuth
			and altitude locally without any external API. I'm also the maintainer of Feilian-3D, a 3-D
			generative model framework documented in the <a href="/docs/" class="citrus-link">Docs</a> section.
		</p>
		<h2>Get in touch</h2>
		<p>
			You can find the source code for most of my projects on
			<a
				aria-label="GitHub profile"
				class="citrus-link inline-block"
				href="https://github.com/greensh16"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank">GitHub</a
			>.
		</p>
	</div>

</PageLayout>
